Homepage: https://github.com/carlospolop/PEASS-ng
Description: Privilege Escalation Awesome Scripts SUITE (with colors)
 PEASS-ng provides well-crafted privilege-escalation enumeration
 scripts for Linux (linpeas) and Windows (winPEAS). linpeas.sh scans
 the target for vulnerable services, misconfigurations, credentials and
 more; winPEAS.bat does the same for Windows hosts.
